d improves weapon handling when wounded—even when this weapon is stowed."},{"name":"Offhand Strike","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/599d73ea677633784655fc4161327c14.png","desc":"Final blows grant additional weapon range, stability, and accuracy when firing from the hip for a short duration."},{"name":"Feeding Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/89d7e65f5ebe8d291ea96f128765921d.png","desc":"Each rapid kill with this weapon progressively increases reload speed for a short time."},{"name":"Ambitious Assassin","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1f93b49c7f10b1be70083f913a3c5d63.png","desc":"Overflows the magazine based on the number of rapid kills before reloading."},{"name":"Firefly","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/629e225e6f8214326bc1eb0a911a6f6d.png","desc":"Precision kills with this weapon increase reload speed and cause the target to explode, dealing Solar damage to nearby enemies."},{"name":"Enlightened Action","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/cee13d00e65346dacc05562c80f537da.png","desc":"Dealing damage improves reload speed and handling."},{"name":"Overflow","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3165fec56b59363fa974a11f5730f4ec.png","desc":"Picking up Special or Heavy ammo automatically loads this weapon beyond normal capacity."},{"name":"Demolitionist","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/da009697110e06b65d6f827b3b6d5f70.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate grenade energy. Activating your grenade ability reloads this weapon from reserves."},{"name":"Fourth Time's the Charm","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a5edd4e751e1aa34bf8328a63b121e71.png","desc":"Rapidly landing precision hits will return two rounds to the magazine."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Hatchling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2f7e898e2231900ac968ffb2080fc02b.png","desc":"Precision final blows or rapidly defeating targets with this weapon spawns a Threadling at the target's location."},{"name":"Golden Tricorn","icon":"/